        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge an unstoppable army from a range of diverse fighters to fight against the forces of Wrath in this strategic auto-battler. Draft your army to diverse situations, organize your army to attack with force, and watch autonomous battles unfold in a symphony of emergent strategy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From humble skirmishes to grand-scale warfare, your choices dictate the flow of battle. Every round starts with the preparation phase where you’ll manage your economy, draft new units from the store,  reroll and position units. Then follows the explosive combat phase, where your meticulously assembled legions clash with the wave of creatures coming your way. <br><br>Your fight spans across multiple challenges, each with their own selection of enemies to fight against. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099050/extras/98837fc6e07a7d1c853f7efb8c96cb8e.avif?t=1762857735\" width=960 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a legion of unique combatants:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Battalions:</strong> Lead groups units, including resilient melee tanks and precise ranged sharpshooters  and devastating damage dealers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching scenarios:</strong> Take on different enemies and challenges to test your tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your dominion with strategic depth:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Economy:</strong> Amass gold and resources with every win to build your army. Navigate a randomized shop, complete with rerolls and rare units, offering endless strategic pivots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Positioning:</strong> The grid is your canvas! Place your units with foresight, securing formation bonuses, protecting your vital backline, and leveraging terrain and obstacles to outmaneuver your opponent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Isles of Wrath</strong>: obliterate the enemy, manage your economy and dominate the isles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099050/extras/f527a9f20a4a0816b3884b9745221af5.avif?t=1762857735\" width=960 height=310 /></span></p>",
